TEXT -1008 -216 Left 2 !.tran 0 100u 50u 1n\n \n.param first_edge 200 ; 200th edge\n.param last_edge 700 ; 700th edge\n.param zero_crossing_voltage 0 ; voltage at zero crossing\n.meas tran T1 find time when V(osc_out)={zero_crossing_voltage} rise {first_edge}\n.meas tran T2 find time when V(osc_out)={zero_crossing_voltage} rise {last_edge}\n.meas tran Frequency param ({last_edge}-{first_edge})/(T2-T1)\n.options numdgt=7\n.options plotwinsize=0\n.model 1SV324 D(Is=2.593E-15 Rs=0.4 N=1.024 BV=10 Ibv=1.00E-04 Cjo=7.672E-11 Vj=100 M=49.19)
TEXT -1256 672 Left 2 ;Voltage over varicaps must be limited, so that means that they should be quite large\nin comparison to the capacitors in series.\nUnfortunately, in a series capacitor network, the largest capacitor doesn't have a lot \nof influence on the frequency.
